section Case_II
/-! ### Case II: $x\in[\frac1{64},\frac14]$ -/

/-- **(7.3)** (🚗) ([DIR], proof of Proposition 7.1, Case II). Running
$\textsc{Partition}_1(\underline{g_{P,2}},[\frac1{64},\frac14])$ shows that
$$G_{P,\beta}(x)>10^{-4}$$
for all $x\in[\frac1{64},\frac14]$ and $\beta\in[\frac12,\beta_0]$. -/
theorem eqn_7_3 (β : ℝ) (hβ : β ∈ Icc 2⁻¹ β₀) (x : ℝ) (hx : x ∈ Icc (64⁻¹ : ℝ) 4⁻¹) :
    G_P β x > 1e-4 := by
  have key := Auto.DIR.CertTest.partition_one (fun xl xu ↦ Auto.DIR.CertTest.g_P_2_lo xl xu - 1 / 10000) (fun y ↦ G_P β y - 1 / 10000)
    Cert73.pts 23 (by norm_num) ?_ ?_ x ?_
  · norm_num at key ⊢; linarith
