for all $x\in[\frac14,\frac12]$ (and $\beta\in[\frac12,\beta_0]$), which finishes the proof of
Proposition 7.1. -/
theorem eqn_7_4 (β : ℝ) (hβ : β ∈ Icc 2⁻¹ β₀) (x : ℝ) (hx : x ∈ Icc (4⁻¹ : ℝ) 2⁻¹) :
    g_P_3 β x > 0.001 := by
  sorry

